#N canvas 100 100 1950 800 12;
#X text 20 10 Chord pattern. Each step has on/accent and a chord root (scale step). Notes are worked out as it plays \, so key \, scale and chord type changes apply straight away.;
#X obj 30 50 inlet;
#X obj 30 700 outlet;
#X obj 30 760 table ockm-pat-\$1-on 128;
#X obj 230 760 table ockm-pat-\$1-deg 128;
#X obj 430 760 array define \$0-sc 7;
#X obj 600 760 array define \$0-ty 4;
